<ans># ManipalCigna Health Insurance Co Ltd — Q1FY25 (Quarter Ended 30 June 2024) Financial Data

I directly read the statutory IRDAI "Public Disclosure" filing (Forms NL-1 through NL-46) for Q1 FY2024-25, hosted on the company's Financial/Public Disclosures page. <doc_source>step10web2</doc_source> This filing carries all the required statutory (IGAAP) NL-return figures — NL-4 (Premium Schedule), NL-5 (Claims Schedule), NL-7 (Expenses Schedule), NL-8/10/11 (Balance Sheet schedules), NL-12/12A (Investment Schedule), NL-20 (Analytical Ratios), NL-25/26 (Solvency), and NL-31 (Investment Yield).

No separate "Investor Presentation Q1FY25" exists for this insurer (unlisted equity), so all figures below are sourced from the single NL disclosure filing. The FY24-25 Annual Report <doc_source>step10web2</doc_source> covers the full year ended 31-Mar-2025 and does not carry standalone Q1 figures — it was used only for cross-verification of methodology, not as a data source for this quarter.

